182
00:14:25,640 --> 00:14:28,240
Our last topic for this lecture is exceptions.

183
00:14:28,240 --> 00:14:31,800
You may have seen exceptions when programming.

184
00:14:31,800 --> 00:14:37,200
Perhaps it was arithmetic overflow or an unsupported instruction attempts to execute.

185
00:14:37,200 --> 00:14:42,440
Other exceptions include page faults while accessing memory or an IO device had a status

186
00:14:42,440 --> 00:14:43,560
