187
00:14:43,560 --> 00:14:48,080
These surprises are called exceptions because they're not usual or common.

188
00:14:48,080 --> 00:14:52,520
You can think of them as surprise procedure calls that get invoked at any time while executing

189
00:14:52,520 --> 00:14:56,160
