190
00:14:56,160 --> 00:15:00,360
There are two types of exceptions, interrupts and traps.

191
00:15:00,360 --> 00:15:05,440
Interrupts happen outside from the processor due to an event from IO devices.

192
00:15:05,440 --> 00:15:11,080
